  "description": "<div>Quilted Design with Chain Strap,</div>\n<div>Keep your essentials close in style with the Luxury Crossbody Wallet Phone Case. Featuring a quilted leather-look design and a gold-accent chain strap, this case is both fashionable and functional. The built-in mini wallet pocket is perfect for carrying cash, cards, or small must-haves, making it an ideal choice for on-the-go convenience.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>✨ Features:</div>\n<div><span> • Quilted faux-leather design with luxe gold hardware</span></div>\n<div><span> • Detachable crossbody chain strap for hands-free carry</span></div>\n<div><span> • Built-in mini wallet pocket with secure clasp</span></div>\n<div><span> • Shock-resistant protective phone cover</span></div>\n<div><span> • Elegant and practical – perfect for daily wear or special outings</span></div>\n<div><span> • Compatible with various iPhone models</span></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>This case doubles as a stylish mini bag and a protective phone cover – the perfect blend of fashion and function for modern lifestyles.</div>",
